      "functionality": "Top-level controller that exposes Wishbone access to the PicoRV32 subsystem, firmware-visible CSR/MMIO registers, and bounded model transport to an external runtime. It integrates register decode, request framing, response validation, timeout supervision, safe fallback, and command clamping to produce a deterministic actuator command.",
      "responsibilities": [
        "Drive all external outputs directly from RTL.",
        "Fan out clock and reset to synchronous submodules.",
        "Bridge Wishbone/CPU-side control to the firmware-visible CSR/MMIO registers.",
        "Emit bounded model requests and receive bounded model responses.",
        "Enforce safety supervision, timeout, sequence checking, and clamp behavior.",
        "Expose deterministic status and fault signaling.",
        "Ensure no top-level output is driven only by a child input."
      ],
      "must_drive": [
        "wb_dat_o",
        "wb_ack_o",
        "wb_stall_o",
