        "reset_behavior": "Reset to idle-safe state, clear outstanding request state and counters, deassert request-valid and output-valid, and assert safe fallback until armed.",
        "behavior_rules": [
          "The bridge shall have deterministic synchronous one-cycle or registered behavior.",
          "No combinational loop may exist between response ingress and actuator output.",
          "No tensors, arrays, geometry buffers, or flow-field outputs are exposed.",
          "The bridge only handles compact request/response transport and small state, not bulk payload memory."
        ],
